1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Every transit app rushes you through the city. Dérivée is built for the drift.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The entire metropolis begins shrouded in an ambient Fog of War.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,500
As you walk, your path uncovers Resolution 11 H3 hexagons in real time.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Contiguous cells dissolve off-thread into single macro-polygons, keeping MapLibre GPU rendering locked at 120Hz.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Within 200 meters, transit nodes reveal themselves through the fog.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Tapping any station queries local SQLite headways and live GTFS-RT Protobuf streams in under 10 milliseconds.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Nearby bus lenses provide immediate arrival context without continuous background battery drain.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The Exploration Journal tracks discovery progress across NYC neighborhoods and boroughs.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The interface shifts dynamically between Day Parchment and Midnight Slate based on local solar ephemeris...

10
00:00:58,000 --> 01:04,000
...while shader updates adjust opacity instantly without geometry recomputation.

11
01:04,000 --> 01:14,000
Dérivée: Unlearn your commute. Built purely in native Swift with autonomous AI engineering harnesses. Open source on GitHub.
